OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few light showers possible in
OL,6,Fthe morning then becoming dry and
OL,7,Fbright with some sunny intervals.
OL,8,FQuite mild with the winds lighter than
OL,9,Fof late.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening with
OL,12,Fsome clear spells. Overnight dry with
OL,13,Fsome clear intervals but some areas of
OL,14,Flow cloud forming.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FA mainly dry day with
OL,17,Fvariable cloud and some bright or
OL,18,Fsunny intervals. A few light showers
OL,19,Fpossible near North Channel coasts.
OL,20,FMild again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
