OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Friday and Saturday with occasional
OL,7,Frain, perhaps brighter later Saturday.
OL,8,FThen Sunday dry with some sunny spells.
